<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Link Tidak Ditemukan - Shortlink</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:ital,wght@0,100..800;1,100..800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-black min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
  <div class="text-center px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-700 mb-3 sm:mb-4">404</h1>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-gray-400 mb-6">Link tidak ditemukan atau sudah tidak tersedia.</p>
    <a href="/" class="inline-block w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors">Kembali ke Beranda</a>
  </div>
